 "stimulus_html": "The output of a neural network on data points are given in the table.\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>Data point</b></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>Predicted</b> <span data-math=\"\\widehat y\"></span></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><b>Actual(target) <span data-math=\"y\"></span></b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">1</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span data-math=\"(0.043,1.169,1.019)\"></span></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span data-math=\"(0,1,1)\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">2</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span data-math=\"(-0.149,0.927,-0.136)\"></span></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span data-math=\"(0,1,0)\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">3</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span data-math=\"(0.96,0.237,-0.109)\"></span></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span data-math=\"(1,0,0)\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">4</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span data-math=\"(0.842,-0.148,-0.218)\"></span></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span data-math=\"(1,0,0)\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">5</td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span data-math=\"(0.942,0.838,1.011)\"></span></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span data-math=\"(1,1,1)\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\nCompute the average loss using the following loss functions.",
 "questions": [
