    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "MSE<br>\nData point 1:<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\text{Loss}=\\frac13{\\lbrack{(0-0.043)}^2+{(1-1.169)}^2+{(1-1.019)}^2\\rbrack}=0.0103\"></span><br>\nData point 2:<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\text{Loss}=\\frac13{\\lbrack{(0-(-0.149))}^2+{(1-(0.927))}^2+{(0-(-0.136))}^2\\rbrack}=0.0153\"></span><br>\nData point 3:<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\text{Loss}=\\frac13{\\lbrack{(1-0.96)}^2+{(0-0.237)}^2+{(0-(-0.109))}^2\\rbrack}=0.0232\"></span><br>\nData point 4:<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\text{Loss}=\\frac13{\\lbrack{(1-0.842)}^2+{(0-(-0.148))}^2+{(0-(-0.218))}^2\\rbrack}=0.0315\"></span><br>\nData point 5:<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\text{Loss}=\\frac13{\\lbrack{(1-0.942)}^2+{(1-0.838)}^2+{(1-1.011)}^2\\rbrack}=0.0099\"></span><br>\nAverage loss: <span data-math=\"\\frac15{(0.0103+0.0153+0.0232+0.0315+0.0099)}=0.018\"></span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 510778,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Hinge loss",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"0.499\"></span>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "Hinge loss<br>\n<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\frac1n\\sum_{i=1}^n\\text{max}{(0,1-y_i{\\widehat y}_i)}\"></span><br>\nFirst, compute the values of <span data-math=\"1-y_i{\\widehat y}_i\"></span> . Then if any of these are negative, you would use 0 instead in the sum.<br><br>\nData point 1: <span data-math=\"1-y_1{\\widehat y}_1=1-(0){(0.043)}=1\"></span>. <span data-math=\"1-y_2{\\widehat y}_2=1-{(1)}(1.169)=-0.169\"></span>. <span data-math=\"1-y_3{\\widehat y}_3=1-{(1)}{(1.019)}=-0.019\"></span>. <span data-math=\"\\text{Loss}=\\frac13{\\lbrack1+0+0\\rbrack}=0.333\"></span>.<br>\nData point 2: <span data-math=\"1-y_1{\\widehat y}_1=1-{(0)}{(-0.149)}=1\"></span>. <span data-math=\"1-y_2{\\widehat y}_2=1-{(1)}{(0.927)}=0.073\"></span>. <span data-math=\"1-y_3{\\widehat y}_3=1-{(0)}{(-0.136)}=1\"></span>. <span data-math=\"\\text{Loss}=\\frac13{\\lbrack1+0.073+1\\rbrack}=0.691\"></span>.<br>\nData point 3: <span data-math=\"1-y_1{\\widehat y}_1=1-{(1)}{(0.96)}=0.04\"></span>. <span data-math=\"1-y_2{\\widehat y}_2=1-(0){(0.237)}=1\"></span>. <span data-math=\"1-y_3{\\widehat y}_3=1-{(0)}{(-0.109)}=1\"></span>. <span data-math=\"\\text{Loss}=\\frac13{\\lbrack0.04+1+1\\rbrack}=0.68\"></span>.<br>\nData point 4: <span data-math=\"1-y_1{\\widehat y}_1=1-{(1)}{(0.842)}=0.158\"></span>. <span data-math=\"1-y_2{\\widehat y}_2=1-{(0)}{(-0.148)}=1\"></span>. <span data-math=\"1-y_3{\\widehat y}_3=1-{(0)}{(-0.218)}=1\"></span>. <span data-math=\"\\mathrm{Loss}=\\frac13{\\lbrack0.158+1+1\\rbrack}=0.719\"></span>.<br>\nData point 5: <span data-math=\"1-y_1{\\widehat y}_1=1-{(1)}{(0.942)}=0.058\"></span>. <span data-math=\"1-y_2{\\widehat y}_2=1-{(1)}{(0.838)}=0.162\"></span>. <span data-math=\"1-y_3{\\widehat y}_3=1-{(1)}{(1.011)}=-0.1011\"></span>. <span data-math=\"\\text{Loss}=\\frac13{\\lbrack0.058+0.162+0\\rbrack}=0.073\"></span>.<br>\nAverage loss: <span data-math=\"\\frac15{(0.333+0.691+0.68+0.719+0.073)}=0.499\"></span>\n"
    }
   ],
